1. D. Freedman, R. Pisani and R. Purves, *Statistics*, 4th ed., Norton (2007), chapters 3 to 5.
2. J. W. Tukey, *Exploratory Data Analysis*, Addison-Wesley (1977) (the five-number summary).
3. H. A. Sturges, "The choice of a class interval", *Journal of the American Statistical Association* 21 (1926) 65–66.
